# RolloverScoreControl1 / 2 (listing 2748-2775): a_roll5 and a_roll2 each score the table value, 30,000.
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
50 poke info_text_box message_field 2
100 event a_roll5 ControlCollision
100 expect n_score == 30000 delta 99
110 event a_roll2 ControlCollision
110 expect n_score == 30000 delta 109
200 quit
